  "id": "metabolic-screening",
  "term": "metabolic screening",
  "definition": "Metabolic screening is preventive testing used to check for cardiometabolic health risks, especially problems such as diabetes and abnormal blood lipids. In this context, it refers to measures like haemoglobin A1c and lipid testing to identify physical health risks that may be missed in people with serious mental illness.",
